# Part 9 — Add Dataset to DVC

Run:

```powershell
dvc add data/raw/students.csv
```

DVC will create:

```text
data/raw/students.csv.dvc
```

The actual dataset is now tracked by DVC rather than Git.

Then:

```powershell
git add .
git commit -m "Add student dataset"
git push
```

---

# Part 10 — Run the Pipeline

Now run:

```powershell
dvc repro
```

DVC will execute:

```text
Running stage 'prepare'
Running stage 'train'
Running stage 'evaluate'
```

You should see:

```text
Data preparation completed
Model training completed
Accuracy: ...
```

