# Final Pipeline

Your complete setup is:

```text
        students.csv
             │
             ▼
       ┌───────────┐
       │  PREPARE  │
       └───────────┘
             │
             ▼
      prepared.csv
             │
             ▼
       ┌───────────┐
       │   TRAIN   │
       └───────────┘
             │
             ▼
         model.pkl
             │
             ▼
       ┌───────────┐
       │ EVALUATE  │
       └───────────┘
             │
             ▼
       metrics.json
```

DVC tracks the dependencies/outputs of these stages, while Git records the pipeline and dataset-version metadata. `dvc repro` is then used to reproduce the pipeline. ([Docker Documentation][1])

